  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Azimio Rice Milling Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice Production and Processing, Beneficiaries Azimio has 77 small holder producer farmer members, of which 41 are women., The Azimio Mswiswi High Quality Rice Millers is a Grain Producers company located in Mbarali District in the Mbeya Region. This grant aims to build the capacity of Azimio so they can access regional markets to sell their rice. Grant funding will be used for operational support and to provide training, finance a study tour, and support production by establishing a revolving fund that AMHQRM will use to purchase and resell inputs including seeds, fertilizers, and pesticides to its farmer members.</narrative>
  </description>
